Reason:
The use of hard-coded strings "AMBARI_SERVER" and "AMBARI" makes the code less maintainable. If the component names change or are referenced inconsistently, the system may fail to recognize or properly handle the Ambari server component, leading to functionality issues.

The code statements that fix the bug are:
```java
private static final String GET_AMBARI_LDAP_CONFIG_URI = String.format("/api/v1/services/%s/components/%s/configurations?%s=%s&fields=%s",
